    {
      "id": "8a786f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "Students must earn a \"C-\" grade or higher in all courses required in the major. The Associate Degree for Transfer (ADT) is compatible with the B.A. in English at Sacramento State. Students pursuing the Associate Degree for Transfer must complete all lower-division major coursework with a \"C\" or better. Students must take at least one British Literature survey (ENGL 40A or ENGL 40B), and at least one American Literature survey (ENGL 50A or ENGL 50B). The following courses may not be included toward the major: ENGL 1, ENGL 1C, ENGL 1X, ENGL 3, ENGL 3M, ENGL 5, ENGL 5M, ENGL 10, ENGL 10M, ENGL 11, ENGL 11M, ENGL 20, ENGL 20M, ENGL 60, ENGL 60M, ENGL 86, ENGL 87, ENGL 109M, ENGL 109W, and ENGL 109X. For more information, please visit: Department of English .",
      "contentHtml": "<ol><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Students must earn a \"C-\" grade or higher in all courses required in the major.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The Associate Degree for Transfer (ADT) is compatible with the B.A. in English at Sacramento State. Students pursuing the Associate Degree for Transfer must complete all lower-division major coursework with a \"C\" or better.</span></li><li><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Students must take at least one British Literature survey (ENGL 40A or ENGL 40B), and at least one American Literature survey (ENGL 50A or ENGL 50B).</strong></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The following courses may </span><u style=\"font-size: 14px;\">not</u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> be included toward the major: ENGL 1, ENGL 1C, ENGL 1X, ENGL 3, ENGL 3M, ENGL 5, ENGL 5M, ENGL 10, ENGL 10M, ENGL 11, ENGL 11M, ENGL 20, ENGL 20M, ENGL 60, ENGL 60M, ENGL 86, ENGL 87, ENGL 109M, ENGL 109W, and ENGL 109X. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">For more information, please visit: </span><a href=\"https://www.csus.edu/college/arts-letters/english/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(41, 98, 255);\"><strong>Department of English</strong></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.</span></li></ol>"
    }
